   "lines": [
    "Country prettier; bottoms",
    "narrower hemmed in",
    "by bold bluffs, with",
    "pines scattered over them.",
    "Shot a dozen sage",
    "hens and prairie",
    "chicken with shot",
    "gun; and late in",
    "evening while riding",
    "through a dense",
    "swamp caught sight",
    "of a yearling white",
    "tail buck, standing",
    "in a marshy opening;",
    "he was fifty yards",
    "off, and did not",
    "see me; kneeling I",
    "shot him through the",
    "heart."
   ],
